qed:s21,s15:eqtr3d |- ( ( ( V : NN --> RR /\ ( V ` 1 ) = 1 /\ A. a e. NN A. b e. NN ( ( a gcd b ) = 1 -> ( V ` ( a x. b ) ) = ( ( V ` a ) x. ( V ` b ) ) ) ) /\ ( D e. NN /\ ( mmu ` D ) =/= 0 ) ) -> ( V ` D ) = prod_ p e. { r e. Prime | r || D } ( V ` p ) )
